#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "Config group names are mapping keys. Their values are file paths relative to the `source-directory` option, which defaults to the directory containing `composer.json`."
msgstr "Los nombres de los grupos de configuración son las claves del array. Sus valores son rutas de archivo relativas a la opción `source-directory`, que por defecto es el directorio que contiene `composer.json`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "A string value loads one file."
msgstr "Un valor de tipo cadena carga un solo archivo."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "An array loads and merges multiple files in the given order."
msgstr "Un array carga y fusiona varios archivos en el orden indicado."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "`?` marks an optional file."
msgstr "`?` marca un archivo opcional."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "`*` marks a wildcard path."
msgstr "`*` marca una ruta con comodines."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "`$group` references another config group to be merged."
msgstr "`$group` hace referencia a otro grupo de configuración que se fusionará."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "The `params` group is special: its values are available as `$params` in other config files by default."
msgstr "El grupo `params` es especial: por defecto, sus valores están disponibles como `$params` en los demás archivos de configuración."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "You can read more in the [yiisoft/config documentation](https://github.com/yiisoft/config/blob/master/README.md)."
msgstr "Más información en la [documentación de yiisoft/config](https://github.com/yiisoft/config/blob/master/README.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Config files"
msgstr "Archivos de configuración"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "Now, as you know how the plugin assembles configs, look at the `config/` directory structure used by the default application template:"
msgstr "Ahora que sabes cómo ensambla el plugin las configuraciones, echa un vistazo a la estructura del directorio `config/` que usa la plantilla de aplicación predeterminada:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"common/\n"
"    bootstrap.php\n"
"    params.php\n"
"    routes.php\n"
"    di/\n"
"        *.php\n"
"console/\n"
"    params.php\n"
"environments/\n"
"    dev/\n"
"        params.php\n"
"    prod/\n"
"        params.php\n"
"    test/\n"
"        params.php\n"
"web/\n"
"    params.php\n"
"    di/\n"
"        *.php\n"
".merge-plan.php\n"
"configuration.php\n"
msgstr ""
"common/\n"
"    bootstrap.php\n"
"    params.php\n"
"    routes.php\n"
"    di/\n"
"        *.php\n"
"console/\n"
"    params.php\n"
"environments/\n"
"    dev/\n"
"        params.php\n"
"    prod/\n"
"        params.php\n"
"    test/\n"
"        params.php\n"
"web/\n"
"    params.php\n"
"    di/\n"
"        *.php\n"
".merge-plan.php\n"
"configuration.php\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "This structure follows the groups defined in `config/configuration.php`:"
msgstr "Esta estructura sigue los grupos definidos en `config/configuration.php`:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "`params`, `params-web`, and `params-console` load parameter files from `common/`, `web/`, and `console/`."
msgstr "`params`, `params-web` y `params-console` cargan los archivos de parámetros de `common/`, `web/` y `console/`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "`di` and `di-web` load container definitions from `common/di/` and `web/di/`."
msgstr "`di` y `di-web` cargan las definiciones del contenedor de `common/di/` y `web/di/`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "`routes` and `bootstrap` load `common/routes.php` and `common/bootstrap.php`."
msgstr "`routes` y `bootstrap` cargan `common/routes.php` y `common/bootstrap.php`."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "`config-plugin-environments` adds environment-specific parameter files from `environments/dev/`, `environments/test/`, and `environments/prod/`."
msgstr "`config-plugin-environments` añade los archivos de parámetros específicos de cada entorno de `environments/dev/`, `environments/test/` y `environments/prod/`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "At runtime, `.merge-plan.php` stores the assembled merge plan generated from `configuration.php`."
msgstr "En tiempo de ejecución, `.merge-plan.php` almacena el plan de fusión ensamblado que se genera a partir de `configuration.php`."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Container configuration"
msgstr "Configuración del contenedor"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "The application consists of services registered in a [dependency container](di-container.md). In the default template, direct container definitions live in `config/common/di/*.php` and `config/web/di/*.php`."
msgstr "La aplicación se compone de servicios registrados en un [contenedor de dependencias](di-container.md). En la plantilla predeterminada, las definiciones directas del contenedor están en `config/common/di/*.php` y `config/web/di/*.php`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "Definitions from `common/di/` are shared by web and console entry points. The `di-web` group adds web-specific definitions from `web/di/`. The `di-console` group currently reuses the shared `di` definitions without extra files."
msgstr "Las definiciones de `common/di/` se comparten entre los puntos de entrada web y de consola. El grupo `di-web` añade definiciones específicas de la web desde `web/di/`. Actualmente, el grupo `di-console` reutiliza las definiciones compartidas de `di` sin archivos adicionales."

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Shared\\ApplicationParams;\n"
"\n"
"/** @var array $params */\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    ApplicationParams::class => [\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'name' => $params['application']['name'],\n"
"            'charset' => $params['application']['charset'],\n"
"            'locale' => $params['application']['locale'],\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Shared\\ApplicationParams;\n"
"\n"
"/** @var array $params */\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    ApplicationParams::class => [\n"
"        '__construct()' => [\n"
"            'name' => $params['application']['name'],\n"
"            'charset' => $params['application']['charset'],\n"
"            'locale' => $params['application']['locale'],\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "Config plugin passes the special `$params` variable to all config files. The definition uses it to configure services."
msgstr "El plugin de configuración pasa la variable especial `$params` a todos los archivos de configuración. La definición la usa para configurar servicios."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "The guide on [\"Dependency injection and container\"](di-container.md) describes the configuration format and the idea of dependency injection in detail."
msgstr "La guía [\"Inyección de dependencias y contenedor\"](di-container.md) describe en detalle el formato de configuración y la idea de la inyección de dependencias."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "For convenience, there is a naming convention for custom string keys:"
msgstr "Por comodidad, existe una convención de nombres para las claves de cadena personalizadas:"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "Prefix package name such as `yiisoft/cache-file/custom-definition`."
msgstr "Usa el nombre del paquete como prefijo, por ejemplo `yiisoft/cache-file/custom-definition`."

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "In case configuration are for the application itself, skip package prefix, such as `custom-definition`."
msgstr "Si la configuración es de la propia aplicación, omite el prefijo del paquete, por ejemplo `custom-definition`."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Service providers"
msgstr "Proveedores de servicios"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "As an alternative to registering dependencies directly, you can use service providers. A service provider is a class that returns a reusable set of container definitions and extensions."
msgstr "Como alternativa a registrar las dependencias directamente, puedes usar proveedores de servicios. Un proveedor de servicios es una clase que devuelve un conjunto reutilizable de definiciones y extensiones del contenedor."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "The default template exposes three config groups for service providers: `di-providers`, `di-providers-web`, and `di-providers-console`. In the template they are initialized as empty arrays in `config/configuration.php`, and you can later populate them inline or switch them to load values from files."
msgstr "La plantilla predeterminada expone tres grupos de configuración para proveedores de servicios: `di-providers`, `di-providers-web` y `di-providers-console`. En la plantilla se inicializan como arrays vacíos en `config/configuration.php`, y más adelante puedes rellenarlos directamente o hacer que carguen sus valores desde archivos."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "Prefer direct container configuration for application services with a simple definition: a class name, an interface implementation, constructor arguments from `$params`, or a closure that creates a single service."
msgstr "Para los servicios de la aplicación con una definición sencilla, es preferible la configuración directa del contenedor: un nombre de clase, la implementación de una interfaz, argumentos del constructor tomados de `$params` o un closure que crea un único servicio."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "Use a service provider when the registration itself is a reusable unit:"
msgstr "Usa un proveedor de servicios cuando el propio registro sea una unidad reutilizable:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "A package registers several related services, aliases, or extensions."
msgstr "Un paquete registra varios servicios, alias o extensiones relacionados."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "A service registration also needs supporting definitions."
msgstr "El registro de un servicio necesita además definiciones auxiliares."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "The same registration should be reused in several applications."
msgstr "El mismo registro debe reutilizarse en varias aplicaciones."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "Registration depends on optional classes or environment-specific decisions."
msgstr "El registro depende de clases opcionales o de decisiones específicas de cada entorno."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "Use a factory class when construction logic belongs to one service. A factory returns an object. A service provider returns definitions for several related services."
msgstr "Usa una clase factoría cuando la lógica de construcción pertenezca a un único servicio. Una factoría devuelve un objeto. Un proveedor de servicios devuelve definiciones para varios servicios relacionados."

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/* @var array $params */\n"
"\n"
"// ...\n"
"use App\\Provider\\CacheProvider;\n"
"use App\\Provider\\MiddlewareProvider;\n"
"// ...\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    // ...\n"
"    'yiisoft/yii-web/middleware' => MiddlewareProvider::class,\n"
"    'yiisoft/cache/cache' => new CacheProvider($params['yiisoft/cache-file']['file-cache']['path']),\n"
"    // ...\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"/* @var array $params */\n"
"\n"
"// ...\n"
"use App\\Provider\\CacheProvider;\n"
"use App\\Provider\\MiddlewareProvider;\n"
"// ...\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    // ...\n"
"    'yiisoft/yii-web/middleware' => MiddlewareProvider::class,\n"
"    'yiisoft/cache/cache' => new CacheProvider($params['yiisoft/cache-file']['file-cache']['path']),\n"
"    // ...\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "In this config keys are provider names. By convention these are `vendor/package-name/provider-name`. Values are provider class names or provider instances. These classes could be either created in the project itself or provided by a package."
msgstr "En esta configuración, las claves son nombres de proveedores. Por convención, tienen la forma `vendor/package-name/provider-name`. Los valores son nombres de clases de proveedores o instancias de proveedores. Estas clases pueden crearse en el propio proyecto o venir de un paquete."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "If you need to configure some options for a service, similar to direct container configuration, take values from `$params` and pass them to providers."
msgstr "Si necesitas configurar algunas opciones de un servicio, igual que con la configuración directa del contenedor, toma los valores de `$params` y pásalos a los proveedores."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "Provider should implement `Yiisoft\\Di\\ServiceProviderInterface`. Below is a provider for a cache service:"
msgstr "Un proveedor debe implementar `Yiisoft\\Di\\ServiceProviderInterface`. A continuación se muestra un proveedor para un servicio de caché:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use Psr\\Container\\ContainerInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\SimpleCache\\CacheInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Aliases\\Aliases;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Cache\\Cache;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Cache\\CacheInterface as YiiCacheInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Cache\\File\\FileCache;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Di\\ServiceProviderInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class CacheProvider implements ServiceProviderInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private string $cachePath = '@runtime/cache'\n"
"    )\n"
"    {\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function getDefinitions(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [\n"
"            CacheInterface::class => function (ContainerInterface $container) {\n"
"                $aliases = $container->get(Aliases::class);\n"
"\n"
"                return new FileCache($aliases->get($this->cachePath));\n"
"            },\n"
"            YiiCacheInterface::class => Cache::class,\n"
"        ];\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function getExtensions(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [];\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"use Psr\\Container\\ContainerInterface;\n"
"use Psr\\SimpleCache\\CacheInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Aliases\\Aliases;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Cache\\Cache;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Cache\\CacheInterface as YiiCacheInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Cache\\File\\FileCache;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Di\\ServiceProviderInterface;\n"
"\n"
"final readonly class CacheProvider implements ServiceProviderInterface\n"
"{\n"
"    public function __construct(\n"
"        private string $cachePath = '@runtime/cache'\n"
"    )\n"
"    {\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function getDefinitions(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [\n"
"            CacheInterface::class => function (ContainerInterface $container) {\n"
"                $aliases = $container->get(Aliases::class);\n"
"\n"
"                return new FileCache($aliases->get($this->cachePath));\n"
"            },\n"
"            YiiCacheInterface::class => Cache::class,\n"
"        ];\n"
"    }\n"
"\n"
"    public function getExtensions(): array\n"
"    {\n"
"        return [];\n"
"    }\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Routes"
msgstr "Rutas"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "You can configure how the web application responds to certain URLs in `config/common/routes.php`:"
msgstr "Puedes configurar cómo responde la aplicación web a determinadas URL en `config/common/routes.php`:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md ../src/guide/intro/upgrade-from-v2.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"use App\\Web;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Group;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Group::create()\n"
"        ->routes(\n"
"            Route::get('/')\n"
"                ->action(Web\\HomePage\\Action::class)\n"
"                ->name('home'),\n"
"        ),\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"use App\\Web;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Group;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\Route;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    Group::create()\n"
"        ->routes(\n"
"            Route::get('/')\n"
"                ->action(Web\\HomePage\\Action::class)\n"
"                ->name('home'),\n"
"        ),\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "Read more about it in [\"Routes\"](../runtime/routing.md)."
msgstr "Más información en [\"Enrutamiento y generación de URL\"](../runtime/routing.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md ../src/guide/concept/events.md
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#: ../src/internals/022-config-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Events"
msgstr "Eventos"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "Many services emit certain events that you can attach to.  The default template defines three event config groups in `config/configuration.php`: `events`, `events-web`, and `events-console`. They are empty by default, but you can populate them inline or point them to event config files."
msgstr "Muchos servicios emiten determinados eventos a los que puedes suscribirte. La plantilla predeterminada define tres grupos de configuración de eventos en `config/configuration.php`: `events`, `events-web` y `events-console`. Están vacíos por defecto, pero puedes rellenarlos directamente o hacer que apunten a archivos de configuración de eventos."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "The configuration is an array where keys are event names and values are arrays of handlers:"
msgstr "La configuración es un array cuyas claves son nombres de eventos y cuyos valores son arrays de manejadores:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"return [\n"
"    EventName::class => [\n"
"        // Just a regular closure, it will be called from the Dispatcher \"as is\".\n"
"        static fn (EventName $event) => someStuff($event),\n"
"        \n"
"        // A regular closure with an extra dependency. All the parameters after the first one (the event itself)\n"
"        // will be resolved from your DI container within `yiisoft/injector`.\n"
"        static fn (EventName $event, DependencyClass $dependency) => someStuff($event),\n"
"        \n"
"        // An example with a regular callable. If the `staticMethodName` method has some dependencies,\n"
"        // they will be resolved the same way as in the earlier example.\n"
"        [SomeClass::class, 'staticMethodName'],\n"
"        \n"
"        // Non-static methods are allowed too. In this case, `SomeClass` will be instantiated by your DI container.\n"
"        [SomeClass::class, 'methodName'],\n"
"        \n"
"        // An object of a class with the `__invoke` method implemented\n"
"        new InvokableClass(),\n"
"        \n"
"        // In this case, the `InvokableClass` with the `__invoke` method will be instantiated by your DI container\n"
"        InvokableClass::class,\n"
"        \n"
"        // Any invokable class definition may be here as long as `$container->has('the definition')` is true.\n"
"        'di-alias'\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"return [\n"
"    EventName::class => [\n"
"        // Un closure normal; el despachador (Dispatcher) lo llamará \"tal cual\".\n"
"        static fn (EventName $event) => someStuff($event),\n"
"        \n"
"        // Un closure normal con una dependencia adicional. Todos los parámetros posteriores al primero (el propio evento)\n"
"        // se resolverán desde tu contenedor DI mediante `yiisoft/injector`.\n"
"        static fn (EventName $event, DependencyClass $dependency) => someStuff($event),\n"
"        \n"
"        // Un ejemplo con un callable normal. Si el método `staticMethodName` tiene dependencias,\n"
"        // se resolverán del mismo modo que en el ejemplo anterior.\n"
"        [SomeClass::class, 'staticMethodName'],\n"
"        \n"
"        // También se permiten métodos no estáticos. En este caso, tu contenedor DI creará la instancia de `SomeClass`.\n"
"        [SomeClass::class, 'methodName'],\n"
"        \n"
"        // Un objeto de una clase que implementa el método `__invoke`\n"
"        new InvokableClass(),\n"
"        \n"
"        // En este caso, tu contenedor DI creará la instancia de `InvokableClass`, que tiene el método `__invoke`\n"
"        InvokableClass::class,\n"
"        \n"
"        // Aquí puede ir cualquier definición de clase invocable, siempre que `$container->has('the definition')` sea true.\n"
"        'di-alias'\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "Read more about it in [\"Events\"](events.md)."
msgstr "Más información en [\"Eventos\"](events.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
#: ../src/guide/structure/designing-packages.md
#: ../src/internals/022-config-groups.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parámetros"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "Base parameters are stored in `config/common/params.php`. They are then extended by `config/web/params.php`, `config/console/params.php`, and environment-specific files under `config/environments/`."
msgstr "Los parámetros base se guardan en `config/common/params.php`. Después los amplían `config/web/params.php`, `config/console/params.php` y los archivos específicos de cada entorno dentro de `config/environments/`."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"> [!TIP]\n"
"> Don't use parameters, constants, or environment variables directly in your application, configure\n"
"> services instead.\n"
msgstr ""
"> [!TIP]\n"
"> No uses parámetros, constantes ni variables de entorno directamente en tu aplicación; en su lugar,\n"
"> configura servicios.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "The default application `common/params.php` looks like the following:"
msgstr "El archivo `common/params.php` de la aplicación predeterminada tiene este aspecto:"

#. type: Fenced code block (php)
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Shared\\ApplicationParams;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Aliases\\Aliases;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Assets\\AssetManager;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Definitions\\Reference;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\CurrentRoute;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\UrlGeneratorInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\View\\Renderer\\CsrfViewInjection;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'application' => require __DIR__ . '/application.php',\n"
"\n"
"    'yiisoft/aliases' => [\n"
"        'aliases' => require __DIR__ . '/aliases.php',\n"
"    ],\n"
"\n"
"    'yiisoft/view' => [\n"
"        'basePath' => null,\n"
"        'parameters' => [\n"
"            'assetManager' => Reference::to(AssetManager::class),\n"
"            'applicationParams' => Reference::to(ApplicationParams::class),\n"
"            'aliases' => Reference::to(Aliases::class),\n"
"            'urlGenerator' => Reference::to(UrlGeneratorInterface::class),\n"
"            'currentRoute' => Reference::to(CurrentRoute::class),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"\n"
"    'yiisoft/yii-view-renderer' => [\n"
"        'viewPath' => null,\n"
"        'layout' => '@src/Web/Shared/Layout/Main/layout.php',\n"
"        'injections' => [\n"
"            Reference::to(CsrfViewInjection::class),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"
msgstr ""
"<?php\n"
"\n"
"declare(strict_types=1);\n"
"\n"
"use App\\Shared\\ApplicationParams;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Aliases\\Aliases;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Assets\\AssetManager;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Definitions\\Reference;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\CurrentRoute;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Router\\UrlGeneratorInterface;\n"
"use Yiisoft\\Yii\\View\\Renderer\\CsrfViewInjection;\n"
"\n"
"return [\n"
"    'application' => require __DIR__ . '/application.php',\n"
"\n"
"    'yiisoft/aliases' => [\n"
"        'aliases' => require __DIR__ . '/aliases.php',\n"
"    ],\n"
"\n"
"    'yiisoft/view' => [\n"
"        'basePath' => null,\n"
"        'parameters' => [\n"
"            'assetManager' => Reference::to(AssetManager::class),\n"
"            'applicationParams' => Reference::to(ApplicationParams::class),\n"
"            'aliases' => Reference::to(Aliases::class),\n"
"            'urlGenerator' => Reference::to(UrlGeneratorInterface::class),\n"
"            'currentRoute' => Reference::to(CurrentRoute::class),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"\n"
"    'yiisoft/yii-view-renderer' => [\n"
"        'viewPath' => null,\n"
"        'layout' => '@src/Web/Shared/Layout/Main/layout.php',\n"
"        'injections' => [\n"
"            Reference::to(CsrfViewInjection::class),\n"
"        ],\n"
"    ],\n"
"];\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "For convenience, there is a naming convention about parameters:"
msgstr "Por comodidad, existe una convención de nombres para los parámetros:"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "Group parameters package name such as `yiisoft/cache-file`."
msgstr "Agrupa los parámetros por nombre de paquete, por ejemplo `yiisoft/cache-file`."

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "In case parameters are for the application itself, as in `application`, skip package prefix."
msgstr "Si los parámetros son de la propia aplicación, como en `application`, omite el prefijo del paquete."

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "In case there are many services in the package, such as `file-target` and `file-rotator` in `yiisoft/log-target-file` package, group parameters by service name."
msgstr "Si el paquete tiene varios servicios, como `file-target` y `file-rotator` en el paquete `yiisoft/log-target-file`, agrupa los parámetros por nombre de servicio."

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "Use `enabled` as parameter name to be able to disable or enable a service, such as `yiisoft/yii-debug`."
msgstr "Usa `enabled` como nombre de parámetro para poder activar o desactivar un servicio, como en `yiisoft/yii-debug`."

#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Package configs"
msgstr "Configuraciones de paquetes"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "Config plugin does not copy vendor package configs automatically. It loads them directly from `vendor/` as the vendor layer and combines them with the root package and environment-specific layers."
msgstr "El plugin de configuración no copia automáticamente las configuraciones de los paquetes de terceros. Las carga directamente desde `vendor/` como capa de terceros (vendor) y las combina con la capa del paquete raíz y las capas específicas de cada entorno."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "If you want to customize a package config file in your application, use the `yii-config-copy` Composer command to copy it into your `config/` directory, usually under `config/packages/`. Once copied, the file becomes part of the root package layer, so it can override vendor defaults."
msgstr "Si quieres personalizar el archivo de configuración de un paquete en tu aplicación, usa el comando de Composer `yii-config-copy` para copiarlo a tu directorio `config/`, normalmente dentro de `config/packages/`. Una vez copiado, el archivo pasa a formar parte de la capa del paquete raíz, por lo que puede sobrescribir los valores predeterminados de los paquetes de terceros."

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/concept/configuration.md
msgid "The merge plan stored in `.merge-plan.php` defines how config groups are assembled. If you add new config files or directories and update the root package configuration, rebuild the merge plan with `composer yii-config-rebuild`."
msgstr "El plan de fusión almacenado en `.merge-plan.php` define cómo se ensamblan los grupos de configuración. Si añades nuevos archivos o directorios de configuración y actualizas la configuración del paquete raíz, vuelve a generar el plan de fusión con `composer yii-config-rebuild`."
